                    RESOURCE OVERVIEW
                  </h2>
                  <div className="flex-1 h-px bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-800"></div>
                </div>

                <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                  {/* Left: Resource Bars */}
